<title>UK: CE claims 50.03 pct of Northern.</title>
<headline>CE claims 50.03 pct of Northern.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. group CE Electric had 50.03 percent of bid target Northern Electric by 1130 GMT on Saturday, up from 49.77 percent it held at its own deadline of 1300 GMT on December 20, a spokesman said, but it needs British takeover panel approval for the extra acceptances.</p>
<p>The 782 million stg bid should have closed at 1300 GMT on December 20 but the takeover panel took the highly unusual step of extending the deadline to 1300 GMT on December 24 late on Friday, with the provision that it would be required to approve any further acceptances.</p>
</text>
